  "html": "<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-white-color has-light-green-cyan-background-color has-text-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;padding-top:3.1rem;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:3.1rem;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1\">Your digital business card.<br>Free. In 60 seconds.</h1>\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.5\">Sign up with Google. Share via QR, WhatsApp, or NFC tap. Add a physical card whenever you want.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex is-content-justification-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-primary-color has-ast-global-color-0-background-color has-text-color has-background has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/sign-up/\" style=\"padding-top:1rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:2rem;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700\">Get my free MeCard Profile</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem\">Free forever · No credit card · No app to install · Sign in with Google</p>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem\">Already have a MeCard? <a href=\"/my-account/\">Log in</a></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700\">Live in 60 seconds.</h3>\n\n<p>Sign in with Google, fill three fields, see your live profile. No app to download. The wizard pre-fills your name and photo from your Google account.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700\">Share any way they like.</h3>\n\n<p>QR code, WhatsApp deep-link, native share sheet, vCard download, copy link, email, SMS. Your contact appears in their phone in one tap.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700\">Always one tap away.</h3>\n\n<p>Add MeCard to your home screen. Open it like an app. Share without opening a browser.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/alessio-free.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-80110\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.6201479763679532;width:257px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Frequently asked</h2>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">Is MeCard really free?</h3>\n\n<p>Yes. Free forever for one digital profile. The optional R199 once-off Pro upgrade unlocks branding and custom profile layouts.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">Do I need an app?</h3>\n\n<p>No. MeCard runs in your browser. You can save it to your home screen so it opens like an app.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">How do people see my card?</h3>\n\n<p>They tap your NFC card on their phone, scan your QR, click your WhatsApp share, or click your link. Their phone opens your MeCard profile and they can save your contact in one tap.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">Can I add a physical card later?</h3>\n\n<p>Yes. Once your free profile is live, order a Classic (R299) or Custom (R399) card from inside the management console. Your existing free profile stays exactly as it is.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700\">Is MeCard South African?</h3>\n\n<p>Yes. Built and supported in South Africa. ZAR pricing. Local delivery on physical cards.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-ast-global-color-6-background-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:20px;border-top-right-radius:20px;border-bottom-left-radius:20px;border-bottom-right-radius:20px;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:1.8rem\">Want a physical card too?</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Order yours from inside the MeCard management console after signup. Each card is encoded to your profile so the tap-to-share works straight out of the post.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700\">Classic — R299</h3>\n\n<p>NFC tap-to-share, MeCard branding. Free profile included.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700\">Custom — R399</h3>\n\n<p>Printed with your design. NFC tap-to-share. Free profile included.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700\">Bundle</h3>\n\n<p>Card + phone tag in one order. The phone tag is a NFC sticker for the back of your phone — only available in a bundle.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex is-content-justification-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-ast-global-color-5-color has-ast-global-color-0-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/cards/\">See all card options</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-white-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-ast-global-color-3-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-weight:800\">Ready in 60 seconds.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex is-content-justification-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-primary-color has-ast-global-color-0-background-color has-text-color has-background has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/sign-up/\" style=\"padding-top:1rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:1rem;padding-left:2rem;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700\">Get my free MeCard Profile</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>"
